Vnum            10011
Name            沉鎖井階~
Description
井階沿著井壁盤旋下沉，每一階都壓著粗重鎖環與失色符片，腳下像踩在某種仍勉強有效的鎮壓程序上。越往下走，周圍空氣越像被看不見的力量向內壓縮，讓人連呼吸都得放得極慢。
~
SectorType      SECT_INSIDE

#Exit
Direction       NORTH
ExitVnum        10010
ExitDesc        ~
ExitKeyword     ~
ExitKey         0
End

#Exit
Direction       UP
ExitVnum        10009
ExitDesc        ~
ExitKeyword     ~
ExitKey         0
End

#Exit
Direction       DOWN
ExitVnum        10012
ExitDesc        ~
ExitKeyword     ~
ExitKey         0
End

#Enquire
Keyword         退路~
End

#Enquire
Keyword         井心~
End

End
